const RESOURCE={products:{title:'Products',singular:'Product',path:'/products',key:'products',array:'product',name:'name',fields:['name','sku','description','price','quantity','minimumStock','unit','category','supplier'],columns:['sku','category','supplier','price','quantity','stock'],search:true},categories:{title:'Categories',singular:'Category',path:'/categories',key:'categories',array:'categories',name:'name',fields:['name','description'],columns:['description','createdAt','status'],search:true},suppliers:{title:'Suppliers',singular:'Supplier',path:'/suppliers',key:'suppliers',array:'suppliers',name:'companyName',fields:['companyName','contactPerson','email','phoneNo','address'],columns:['contactPerson','email','phoneNo','status'],search:true}};
function useResource(kind,params={}){const cfg=RESOURCE[kind];return useRequest(()=>resourceApi.list(cfg.path,params),[kind,JSON.stringify(params)])}
function ResourcePage({kind}){const cfg=RESOURCE[kind];const [query,setQuery]=useSearchParams();const search=query.get('search')||'';const stock=kind==='products'?query.get('stock')||'':'';const page=Number(query.get('page')||1);const req=useResource(kind,{page,limit:10,search,...(stock?{stock}:{})});const {rows,pagination}=extract(req.data,cfg.key,cfg.array);const {user}=useAuth();const [target,setTarget]=useState(null);const navigate=useNavigate();const updateQuery=(s,p,nextStock=stock)=>setQuery(Object.fromEntries(Object.entries({search:s||undefined,stock:nextStock||undefined,page:p>1?p:undefined}).filter(([,v])=>v!==undefined)));
 const onStatus=async()=>{try{await resourceApi.status(cfg.path,target._id,!target.isActive);toast.success(`${cfg.singular} ${target.isActive?'deactivated':'activated'}`);setTarget(null);req.retry()}catch(e){toast.error(getErrorMessage(e))}};
 return <><PageHeader title={cfg.title} subtitle={`Browse and manage ${cfg.title.toLowerCase()}.`} action={userHasPermission(user,'catalog:manage')&&<Link to={`${cfg.path}/new`}><Button><Plus size={16}/>Add {cfg.singular}</Button></Link>}/><Panel><div className="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-line p-4"><div className="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><div className="relative w-full max-w-sm"><Search className="absolute left-3 top-2.5 text-ink-3" size={16}/><Input aria-label={`Search ${cfg.title}`} placeholder={`Search ${cfg.title.toLowerCase()}…`} className="pl-9" value={search} onChange={e=>updateQuery(e.target.value,1)}/></div>{kind==='products'&&<Select aria-label="Filter product stock status" className="w-auto min-w-40" value={stock} onChange={e=>updateQuery(search,1,e.target.value)}><option value="">All stock statuses</option><option value="LOW_STOCK">Low stock</option><option value="OUT_OF_STOCK">Out of stock</option></Select>}</div><div className="text-xs text-ink-3">{pagination?`${formatNumber(pagination.totalDocumnet??pagination.totalDocument??0)} records`:''}</div></div>{req.loading?<Loading/>:req.error?<ErrorState error={req.error} retry={req.retry}/>:rows.length===0?<EmptyState title={search||stock?'No matching records':'No records yet'} detail={search||stock?'Try clearing the current filters.':'Add a record to get started.'} action={search||stock?<Button variant="secondary" onClick={()=>updateQuery('',1,'')}>Clear filters</Button>:userHasPermission(user,'catalog:manage')&&<Link to={`${cfg.path}/new`}><Button><Plus size={15}/>Add {cfg.singular}</Button></Link>}/>:<ResourceTable kind={kind} rows={rows} canManage={userHasPermission(user,'catalog:manage')} onEdit={id=>navigate(`${cfg.path}/${id}/edit`)} onStatus={setTarget}/>}<Pagination page={page} pages={pagination?.totalPages||1} onPage={p=>updateQuery(search,p)}/></Panel>{target&&<Confirm title={`${target.isActive?'Deactivate':'Activate'} ${target[cfg.name]}?`} detail={target.isActive?'This record will no longer be available for new operations.':'This record will be available for new operations again.'} action={target.isActive?'Deactivate':'Activate'} onCancel={()=>setTarget(null)} onConfirm={onStatus}/>}</>}
